{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_028_02_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:ce4f30ce6f5f1b694afd06f2695367f0c4345c7757193207bfc5925b307a6e23",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e7de0bb1db2d84f336a0b3dd37d0ba38170ca2f25aaa849ad9776c6c664537e",
      "text": "特别生日蛋糕",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a9487916628b2ab9561f05cef90202ada8167781a3ccba7f3539e95ff15c609",
      "text": "生日临近的某一天，庄一郎被幸广告知了\n生日派对的计划。\n在被问到有什么想吃的或想要的愿望时，\n庄一郎提出了一个请求。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_a:cmd-000014:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_a:cmd-000014:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e7de0bb1db2d84f336a0b3dd37d0ba38170ca2f25aaa849ad9776c6c664537e",
      "text": "特别生日蛋糕",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:339b2e3ae91eede25643ca66fd226dfb70ef56c7a546c9464fe7eb4d5bc622fc",
      "text": "东云。能占用点时间吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:797706ed56bb7d0cf00e8042d2606df98bb597c171ced36f368d76d16055011f",
      "text": "好的。请问有什么事？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58cd64a4eb697dedaf5116bf2a37cc66738a4088b8a2e85effa43dbbae743066",
      "text": "马上就是东云的生日了吧。我和Cafe Parade的\n大家，正在策划你的生日派对呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65964039d0152308e1bf0b58ebcf1b52cf48b281b86202c9657d016c310cd89c",
      "text": "所以，想问问你有什么想吃的、想要的，\n听听你的愿望……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34f3f2348cf067392f05cd2f016d7e8cb93dcc45c17b012a9555b195215c5e74",
      "text": "哎呀。\n原来不打算给我搞惊喜啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1957e264c57fd6c0d00f7c56034a1abded205edc5f2d600acf9b5b366f3ea6f9",
      "text": "反正不管怎样都会被东云看穿的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2118e2e7cecf37ee2b2d051a509e2f0d3b74a6f34b771a05ccca2d952c362fe5",
      "text": "呵呵，原来是这样啊。\n让我想想，要是能为我庆祝的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5de3bd8a37cebd879f43ae92a55a12f05733901f9050359bbb586cbdc890606e",
      "text": "既然如此，我想尝尝大家亲手做的蛋糕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_a:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2ba169677fe18b4fef13f71653546badd3893ebdc9ee1ffb73d064efa4973a7",
      "text": "蛋糕吗。完全没料到啊。大家听了\n大概也会吓一跳吧。我知道了，我会转告他们的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_02_1_2_028_02:1_2_028_02_a:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc37ff64ed69461c5732f4982899957b04f37594149b55b35bca9fc99560ad75",
      "text": "谢谢。\n我会好好期待的。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
